{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is COCOBOY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>In an alternate history 2005</u></strong>, the forgotten 80's platformer COCOBOY has re-entered the public consciousness of a niche few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/hack.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Modify, brute force, and restore</strong></u> unused game mechanics using Modcarts, devices hacked together by tech-savvy fans. Discover clever combinations of mods in order to  progress and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/forum.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Immerse in a new and peculiar fandom</strong></u> through browsing an online forum. Check back as you play to find a community growing in real-time, where you can browse discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/shop.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Collect rare promotional merchandise</u></strong> from online resellers. Decorate your room by spending coins you collect throughout the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and Mouse, Controller, and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several unlockable Modcart abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless merchandise to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack blending classic chiptune and live-recorded acoustics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...and an original 80s cartoon with a functional VHS player?!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/wishlist_now.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prototype version was original developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024. After seeing how much the original game resonated with folks, we decided to keep going and make COCOBOY a full experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589190?t=1751565470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/2d5120e95e24e26750654e7e9f5d2592b18bd221/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751565470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/5938b17814154a7efe56323127fdf21cd0663220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751565470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/5938b17814154a7efe56323127fdf21cd0663220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751565470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is COCOBOY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>In an alternate history 2005</u></strong>, the forgotten 80's platformer COCOBOY has re-entered the public consciousness of a niche few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/hack.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Modify, brute force, and restore</strong></u> unused game mechanics using Modcarts, devices hacked together by tech-savvy fans. Discover clever combinations of mods in order to  progress and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/forum.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Immerse in a new and peculiar fandom</strong></u> through browsing an online forum. Check back as you play to find a community growing in real-time, where you can browse discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/shop.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Collect rare promotional merchandise</u></strong> from online resellers. Decorate your room by spending coins you collect throughout the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and Mouse, Controller, and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several unlockable Modcart abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless merchandise to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack blending classic chiptune and live-recorded acoustics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...and an original 80s cartoon with a functional VHS player?!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/wishlist_now.gif?t=1751565470\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Development History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prototype version was original developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024. After seeing how much the original game resonated with folks, we decided to keep going and make COCOBOY a full experience.</p>","developers":["Adrian Kellman","Cameron Werner"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/ad00779028055f7182d246f9e755f790b90ef545/header.jpg?t=1751565470","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144853,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144853/movie480.mp4?t=1748105350","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144853/movie_max.mp4?t=1748105350"},"name":"Short Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144853/9f9e5caa52545502b6d67cc971556f04c0a87fb0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748105350","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144853/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748105350","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144853/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748105350"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257115677,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115677/movie480.mp4?t=1742402277","max":"http://video.akamai.